add_claim("PHYSIOS ARE A SCAM - REPAIR INDIVIDUALLY: 'it's okay to pay for individual Physios if you must field the same players for consecutive matches, but **do limit it just to a maximum of two players per match or cap the spend within 6 to 8 coins.** To fully restore that stamina of all players, you would need a Rare Physio which will hurt your budget' - and 'Even when I was new, I realized the absolute scam that are physios. **It's so much cheaper to just repair your players' stamina one by one.**'", 3, "stamina/physios-are-a-scam-repair-individually", [e_st])
add_claim("THE SUB-100% PENALTY, which is why the substitution sweet spot matters: 'Each time you finish a match your players will regenerate 30% of their maximum stamina. **If a player starts in a match with less than 100% stamina, they will naturally become fatigued quicker.**' So a tired start compounds - you do not just lose the missing stamina, you lose it faster.", 3, "stamina/sub-100-start-compounds", [e_st])
