add_claim("SQUAD-SIZE GUIDANCE, sitting between the corpus's 16-player minimum and the 64-player cap: wingers and fullbacks tire fastest 'because they move little more than other players', and **19 to 22 players is adequate for a good dominant team** - with one extra player signed as cover for a sending-off or injury.", 3, "squad/19-22-player-target", [e_st])
