add_claim("THE REAL DLS26 EVENT NAMES, consolidated from creator coverage: **Summer Special Event (an online Dream Draft) · World Cup Tournament · World Cup Challenge · Win Streak Event · Spring Cool Trophy · Dynamic Stars Tournament** - plus, from a DOWNGRADED source, the **Summer Showdown** (May) and **Pre-Season Kickoff / European Champions Tour** (August) live-service cup challenges with boosted coin multipliers and legendary scout tokens.", 3, "events/dls26-real-event-names", [e_st])
